          "item": {
            "@type": "NewsArticle",
            "headline": "Paytm Bets on Agentic AI and Wealthtech as Core Growth Pillars After RBI Payments Bank Shutdown",
            "articleSection": "Daily Utility",
            "abstract": "In its Q4 FY26 earnings call, Paytm revealed a strategic pivot toward agentic AI and wealthtech services as the primary drivers of its next growth phase, following the RBI-mandated shutdown of its payments bank arm. The company has ruled out applying for an NBFC licence, instead focusing on AI-powered financial tools and investment products for its existing user base. The shift represents a significant repositioning of one of India's largest fintech platforms toward autonomous AI-driven financial services.",
            "url": "https://www.medianama.com/2026/05/223-paytm-agentic-ai-wealthtech-growth-q4-fy26/",
            "publisher": {
              "@type": "NewsMediaOrganization",
              "name": "The AI Chronicle",
